## Variants

The typography object comes with [13 variants](/material-ui/react-typography/#component) by default:

- h1
- h2
- h3
- h4
- h5
- h6
- subtitle1
- subtitle2
- body1
- body2
- button
- caption
- overline

Each of these variants can be customized individually:

